!Name: 1xN quadratic growth
!Author: Stephen Silver
!The first quadratic growth pattern to fit into a 1xN bounding box, found by Stephen Silver on April 20, 2011. Uses the breeder from Nick Gotts' 26-cell quadratic growth.
